  !>     \brief  BLAS Level 1 API
  !>
  !>     \details
  !>     The copy_batched functions copy each element x_i[j] into y_i[j], for ``j`` = 1 , ... ,
  !>     ``n``; ``i`` = 1 , ... , ``batch_count``:
  !>
  !>         y_i := x_i,
  !>
  !>     where (``x_i``, ``y_i``) is the i-th instance of the batch and
  !>     ``x_i`` and``y_i`` are vectors.
  !>
