  !>
  !>     where ``alpha`` and ``beta`` are scalars, ``x_i`` and ``y_i`` are ``n`` -element vectors,
  !>     and ``A_i`` is an
  !>     ``n`` by ``n`` Hermitian band matrix with ``k`` super-diagonals, for each batch in
  !>     ``i = [1, batch_count`` ].
