  !>
  !>         A_i := A_i + alpha*x_i*y_i**H + conj(alpha)*y_i*x_i**H
  !>
  !>     where ``alpha`` is a complex scalar, ``x_i`` and ``y_i`` are vectors, and ``A_i`` is an
  !>     ``n`` by ``n`` Hermitian matrix for each batch in ``i = [1, batch_count``].
