  !>     \brief  BLAS Level 2 API
  !>
  !>     \details
  !>     The tbsv functions solve:
  !>
  !>          A*x = b or
  !>          A**T*x = b or
  !>          A**H*x = b
  !>
  !>     where ``x`` and ``b`` are vectors and ``A`` is a banded triangular matrix.
  !>
  !>     @param[in] handle - [rocblas_handle]
  !>               handle to the rocBLAS library context queue.
  !>
